 check:['Delay checking for a specific amount of time','Choose one reliable source and stop after checking it','Set a limit on how many times you will check','Name what you can tolerate without certainty','Make a coping plan for the feared outcome','Ask for reassurance once, clearly, rather than repeatedly'],
