 appease:['Pause before agreeing, apologizing, or explaining','Use one honest and respectful sentence','Allow another person to have a reaction without immediately fixing it','Identify your own need before responding to theirs','Remove unnecessary explanations from your message','Check your response with a trusted person before sending it'],
